{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512580/extras/ss_581be48ae2bdf7d746e4d4b5b98b05ce055871c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743799476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead World is a first-person action shooter video game set in a post-apocalyptic Argentina. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SYNOPSIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a result of several armed conflicts between different European countries, the world as we knew it was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Argentina, despite being a neutral country during the conflict, was bombed and today Buenos Aires, its capital, is uninhabitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the first Dead World story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512580/extras/11.png?t=1743799476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carlos and Miguel receive a job in which they will have to go to Rosario to see what happened to a cart that was supposed to reach the Entre R\u00edos settlement of San Diego.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Check each environment for resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Loot the bodies of your enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Fight mutants and bandits alike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Obtain weapons to defend yourself</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The lost wagon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1512580/0a71ee7d8eb851d98317ae102734465bcac207c1.jpg"},{"name":"Hight quality weed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1512580/bb1c99041365ac3fff72d681fba19d04b2a00f52.jpg"},{"name":"No windows","path":"https://cdn.akama