yed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Argentina, despite being a neutral country during the conflict, was bombed and today Buenos Aires, its capital, is uninhabitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the first Dead World story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512580/extras/11.png?t=1743799476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carlos and Miguel receive a job in which they will have to go to Rosario to see what happened to a cart that was supposed to reach the Entre R\u00edos settlement of San Diego.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Check each environment for resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Loot the bodies of your enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Fight mutants and bandits alike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Obtain weapons to defend yourself</p>","developers":["Milanesa Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1376960","name":"Dead World: La Argentina Muerta"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512580/header.jpg?t=1743799476","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120943,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120943/movie480.mp4?t=1743511638","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120943/movie_max.mp4?t=1743511638"},"name":"Dead